{{!-- EMAIL - WORKR 06 - Close active nurture (Day 15). Params: firstName, readinessLink. Subject is set by the sender, not here. --}}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>I'll leave this with you</title>
</head>

<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f4f7fb; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color:#111827;">
  <table
    role="presentation"
    cellpadding="0"
    cellspacing="0"
    border="0"
    width="100%"
    style="width:100%; margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f4f7fb;"
  >
    <tr>
      <td align="center" style="padding:32px 16px;">

        <table
          role="presentation"
          cellpadding="0"
          cellspacing="0"
          border="0"
          width="100%"
          style="width:100%; max-width:620px; background-color:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:14px;"
        >
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:30px 30px 26px 30px;">

              <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:24px; color:#111827;">
                Hi {{firstName}},
              </p>

              <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:24px; color:#111827;">
                I've sent you a few thoughts over the last couple of weeks about interview calls and job switching. I'll stop repeatedly messaging you about the assessment after this.
              </p>

              <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:24px; color:#111827;">
                If you're currently happy where you are, there's nothing you need to do.
              </p>

              <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:24px; color:#111827;">
                But if you're actively trying to move to a stronger engineering role and aren't seeing the interview pipeline you expected, you can still run through the readiness assessment here:
                <a
                  href="{{readinessLink}}"
                  target="_blank"
                  style="color:#2563eb; font-weight:700; text-decoration:underline;"
                >Check your readiness &rarr;</a>
              </p>

              <p style="margin:0 0 24px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:24px; color:#111827;">
                The objective is simple: understand the problem before trying to solve it.
              </p>

              <p style="margin:0; font-size:15px; line-height:24px; color:#111827;">
                All the best,<br />
                Sunyul<br />
                InterviewCall
              </p>

            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>

        <table
          role="presentation"
          cellpadding="0"
          cellspacing="0"
          border="0"
          width="100%"
          style="width:100%; max-width:620px;"
        >
          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding:16px 8px 0 8px;">
              <p style="margin:0; font-size:12px; line-height:18px; color:#64748b;">
                You are receiving this because you signed up on WorkR. If you would rather not hear from us, just reply to this email and let us know.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>

      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
